daeb8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3733221e/uploads/origins/6e3161ca-1eea-4ff5-adeb-6f1e8dccc9fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2a978789f1da9bf265bf4e4ab6804b32 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、いつもお世話になっております。\n今回ご依頼させて頂くのはかいぶつたちとマホラカルトというシナリオの自陣のHO狼さんです。\n\nこちらが詳細のリンクになります↓↓\n\nhttps://twitter.com/ttji_trpg/status/1762380441158615214?t=DJpC8WXNvPHV5UOOL8LRdQ&s=19\n\n構図等全ておまかせで、篝さんの思う彼を描いて頂ければと思います。\n\nいつも陰ながら応援させて頂いております。お手隙の際で構いませんので、宜しければ描いてくださると嬉しいです…！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ap__roo/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b26a8246/uploads/origins/bc37e4c5-02f2-4de3-a438-702d74d37b63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b559cc5c96bf729a63d063e29e93045", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b26a8246/uploads/origins/bc37e4c5-02f2-4de3-a438-702d74d37b63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b559cc5c96bf729a63d063e29e93045, https://si.imgix.net/b26a8246/uploads/origins/bc37e4c5-02f2-4de3-a438-702d74d37b63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e9c04b63e3bbaa3dca17b1c54622873e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b26a8246/uploads/origins/bc37e4c5-02f2-4de3-a438-702d74d37b63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1b6287d22d5f0b06531741ce262018f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "篝さん、前回は素敵なSDキャラクターを描いてくださりありがとうございました…！セッションの際、立ち絵の横に置いたらとても可愛くて嬉しかったです！\n\nまた余裕がありましたらプルガトリウムの夜の自陣をお願いしたくリクエストに参りました。\nポーズは立ち絵の通りではなくて大丈夫ですので、描きやすいものでお願いしたいです。少しお揃い感があると嬉しいです…！\nよろしくお願いします…！\n\nhttps://x.com/tokotrpg/status/1563932419874758658?s=46&t=dF53f10woD2lzqUBbhu80w", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ap__roo/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9516f704/uploads/origins/e738aaa4-889a-4aa7-8b9a-7ff88527715c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=409f7d3afe32651d1877d708cef7043a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9516f704/uploads/origins/e738aaa4-889a-4aa7-8b9a-7ff88527715c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=409f7d3afe32651d1877d708cef7043a, https://si.imgix.net/9516f704/uploads/origins/e738aaa4-889a-4aa7-8b9a-7ff88527715c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a96ee550d398cc8324095903b1d28345 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9516f704/uploads/origins/e738aaa4-889a-4aa7-8b9a-7ff88527715c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f083e08040f10d1e3f314d355ed55e8a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi, can you do a picture of my characters Sparky, Kalki and Owen?\nHere is a reference for Sparky: https://imgur.com/a/NQqWzrY \nHere is a reference for Kalki: https://imgur.com/a/AzaE8Ze \nHere is a reference for Owen: https://imgur.com/a/TPNzVMV \nFor the pose, it would be like a group of friends taking a selfie like this: https://danbooru.donmai.us/posts/5963143?q=selfie+v+ \nSparky would be on the middle position taking the selfie, Kalki would be on the left and Owen would be on the right. Like in the reference, Kalki would be slightly annoyed and Sparky and Owen would be smiling and happy. \nThank you!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ap__roo/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9106c3a5/uploads/origins/b4692c55-e395-4710-9f4e-80c79a32d230?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f8432f1666bd40ae59c2b4064097101", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9106c3a5/uploads/origins/b4692c55-e395-4710-9f4e-80c79a32d230?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f8432f1666bd40ae59c2b4064097101, https://si.imgix.net/9106c3a5/uploads/origins/b4692c55-e395-4710-9f4e-80c79a32d230?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b618c15a990e529c84cd66ae72e54d64 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9106c3a5/uploads